{"id":"2645a0212ae48293","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-reflexive-frame.md","title":"Reflexive Frame","display":"df-reflexive-frame — Reflexive Frame","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-reflexive-frame","aliases":["89-df-reflexive-frame"],"display":"df-reflexive-frame — Reflexive Frame","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-frame]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-reflexive-frame"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-reflexive-frame</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reflexive-frame — Reflexive Frame"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}=(W,R)\">\\(\\mathcal{F}=(W,R)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\)</span> is the\nwell-formed-frame predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Refl}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Refl}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span> 是下述定义的一元自反框架谓词，候选框架 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=(W,R)\">\\(\\mathcal F=(W,R)\\)</span> 的两个分量按上述绑定解释。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflexive\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Refl}(\\mathcal{F})\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\land\n\\forall w\\in W\\;(wRw).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflexive\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Refl}(\\mathcal{F})\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\land\n\\forall w\\in W\\;(wRw).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Refl}(\\mathcal{F})\">\\(\\mathrm{Refl}(\\mathcal{F})\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span>自反</li>\n<li>自反框架验证公理T：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p \\to p\">\\(\\Box p \\to p\\)</span></li>\n<li>S4逻辑对应自反且传递的框架</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{F}=(W,R)$, and $\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)$ is the\nwell-formed-frame predicate from [[89-df-kripke-frame]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Refl}(\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflexive\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Refl}(\\mathcal{F})\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\land\n\\forall w\\in W\\;(wRw).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Refl}(\\mathcal{F})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p \\to p","display":false}],"bytes":889,"backlinks":[{"id":"642c63ec0f3c8567","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-reflexive-frame]]：可及关系自反的框架"},{"id":"16e1ac3c5936268f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Refl}(F)$ and $\\mathrm{Trans}(F)$ are the predicates from\n[[89-df-reflexive-frame]] and [[89-df-transitive-frame]]."},{"id":"b3f39618ac65ba2c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f9af10c36caa5628","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Refl}$ : 自反框架谓词 (see [[89-df-reflexive-frame]])"},{"id":"fcabe060a57a2a7b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-353","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-reflexive-frame]]"}],"outgoing":["c78d4bf1505bda5c"]}